  "reference": "Job 8",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then answered Bildad the Shuhite, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long wilt thou speak these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how long shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the words of thy mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a strong wind?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doth God pervert judgment? or doth the Almighty pervert justice?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thy children have sinned against him, and he have cast them away for their transgression;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou wouldest seek unto God betimes, and make thy supplication to the Almighty;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wert",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pure and upright; surely now he would awake for thee, and make the habitation of thy righteousness prosperous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though thy beginning was small, yet thy latter end should greatly increase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For enquire, I pray thee, of the former age, and prepare thyself to the search of their fathers:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(For we",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are but of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yesterday, and know nothing, because our days upon earth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a shadow:)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall not they teach thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tell thee, and utter words out of their heart?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can the rush grow up without mire? can the flag grow without water?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whilst it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet in his greenness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not cut down, it withereth before any",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "other",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "herb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the paths of all that forget God; and the hypocrite's hope shall perish:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whose hope shall be cut off, and whose trust",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a spider's web.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall lean upon his house, but it shall not stand: he shall hold it fast, but it shall not endure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "green before the sun, and his branch shooteth forth in his garden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His roots are wrapped about the heap,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seeth the place of stones.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If he destroy him from his place, then",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall deny him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I have not seen thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.8.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.8.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the joy of his way, and out of the earth shall others grow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, God will not cast away a perfect",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
